    {
     "title": "Smart boat",
     "text": "With Seanapps, your Lagoon also accompanies you on your smartphone.\nThanks to the mobile app and its on-board unit, you can monitor the status of the main systems on board remotely: battery charge levels, fuel and water tank levels, or even the planning of maintenance operations.\nTo assist you when planning your journey and help you make the most of every trip, Seanapps also lets you plan your routes and monitor your navigation directly from your mobile phone."
    }
